 "emoji": "🪖",
 "sentences": [
  "Senator Henry Wilson personally organized this regiment.",
  "Known as \"Henry Wilson's Regiment,\" it formed in Boston during September 1861.",
  "The soldiers signed up for a three-year term of service.",
  "By October, they arrived in Washington and camped near Arlington.",
  "They spent the entire war fighting with the Army of the Potomac.",
  "Their first combat action happened at the siege of Yorktown."
